# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Licensed guideline content -- MUST NOT be committed.
#
# KDIGO 2024 and NICE NG203 are copyrighted clinical guidelines. This repository
# holds the engine that reads them; it does not redistribute them. Everything
# below either is the guideline text or is derived closely enough from it to be
# the same thing in another shape: parsed pages, chunk files, the record store,
# the generated question expansions, and any index built from them.
#
# An operator supplies their own licensed copies in data/raw/ and builds the
# corpus locally -- see README.md, "Build the corpus".
#
# reports/ previously carried a few small page crops of KDIGO and NICE, in
# presentation.html and citation_highlight_demo.png, shown to illustrate that a
# citation resolves to a bounding box on the page. Both have been removed, and
# the history rewritten so they are not recoverable from an earlier commit.
# No guideline excerpt remains anywhere in this repository.
#
# If that illustration is wanted again, redraw it against a synthetic or
# public-domain page: what it demonstrates is the mechanism, not the text.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
